      "className": "SignalPanner",
      "componentName": "SignalPanner",
      "description": "SignalPanner provides an interactive overview of a signal and stays synchronized with a linked axes. The full signal is displayed in the component, while an outlined viewport indicates the portion currently visible in the linked axes.\n\nUsers can drag the viewport to pan through the signal, drag either viewport edge to adjust the visible time range, click outside the viewport to recenter the view, and use the mouse wheel to zoom in or out. Changes made in the SignalPanner update the linked axes, making it easier to navigate long or densely sampled signals without losing context.",
